Z||000002||87GTZ34||11-01-2001||07:41 PM||||Okay...  for the code 24 the description states that the engine is revving with no throttle and no load and the car is in gear but the wheels aren't turning.  translation - need more info on circumstances for that one.  <BR>code 32 is the EGR switch the computer set it on but the verification switch wasn't activated (mine is curretnly bad and does the same thing.)<P>code 35 is set when idle speed is +/-75 rpm from desired target for more than 45 seconds.  Sounds like you may have a vacuum leak somewhere.  Where is your EGR tube and how did you block it off???<BR>||||reg||1
